From 53907ecd2b47b8be349b1d2fb9ef4b85172629b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luis Felipe Strano Moraes <luis.strano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:45:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in PS1 entity packet reuse hooks

Let applications retain immutable entity commands while preserving the renderer's existing submission order. Keep hooks disabled by default and leave cache keys and source lifetimes with the caller.

Provide a portable fragment helper that rebases internal DMA links and joins each bucket to its current predecessor. Cover malformed chains, shared ownership, overlapping copies, payload preservation and repeated buffer swaps with a portable PS1 test.
